## Description

The main application file  rontend/src/App.tsx contains multiple blocks of duplicate import statements. Specifically, createBrowserRouter, RouterProvider, Navigate, Outlet, and ScrollToTop are imported twice in two separate import blocks. Additionally, StoriesComponent is imported three times across different lines.

## Root Cause

 rontend/src/App.tsx lines 1-16:

`	sx
// Lines 1-8 (first import block)
import { createBrowserRouter, Navigate, Outlet, RouterProvider } from "react-router-dom";
import ScrollToTop from "./components/ScrollToTop";
import StoriesComponent from "./components/stories/stories.component";

// Lines 10-16 (SECOND, completely duplicate block)
import {
  createBrowserRouter,
  RouterProvider,
  Navigate,
  Outlet,
} from "react-router-dom";
import ScrollToTop from "./components/ScrollToTop";

// Line 56 (THIRD import of StoriesComponent)
import StoriesComponent from "./components/stories/stories.component";
`

This appears to be the result of a merge conflict resolution that was not properly cleaned up, or refactoring where old import blocks were left in place.

## Impact

- Violates the DRY (Don't Repeat Yourself) principle
- Creates confusion for developers reading the file - it is unclear which imports are actually used
- TypeScript/ESLint will flag these as warnings or errors depending on configuration
- Indicates incomplete cleanup after a merge or refactor, suggesting the file was not reviewed before committing
- Slightly increases bundle size if tree-shaking does not eliminate the duplicates

## Proposed Fix

Remove the second import block entirely (lines 10-16) and the third import of StoriesComponent (line 56). Keep only the first import block (lines 1-8) plus any other unique imports that may be in the file.

The cleaned up imports should look like:

`	sx
import { createBrowserRouter, Navigate, Outlet, RouterProvider } from "react-router-dom";
import ScrollToTop from "./components/ScrollToTop";
import StoriesComponent from "./components/stories/stories.component";
// ... plus any other unique imports found elsewhere in the file
`

## Files to Modify

-  rontend/src/App.tsx - lines 10-16 (remove entire second import block), line 56 (remove duplicate StoriesComponent import)

## Checklist

- [ ] Identify all duplicate imports in the file
- [ ] Remove the redundant import blocks
- [ ] Verify the application still compiles and runs correctly
- [ ] Run the linter to ensure no new warnings are introduced
